{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/218605f9c417015fc24a5ccc120509ee.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAY DEAD is a fast-paced action game set in the tropical undead island of Porto Morto, where you and your family, the Rottingtons, are living your best afterlife. NO jobs, NO taxes, NO pulse, NO problems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is until C.A.R.E. (Curing Authority of Renegade Entities) shows up to \u201cfix\u201d you, by force. Their Cure Bots are converting zombies back into humans in the name of public safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you don\u2019t need fixing. Being dead is the best thing that ever happened to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/dd6bfacf9d91f463f3b26b8e8d47a60c.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not running from zombies - You are the zombie, fighting off C.A.R.E., a for-profit health tech giant determined to &quot;FIX&quot; you. Bash, bite, and brawl through their Cure Bots before they turn your perfect afterlife into a nine-to-five nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/1f453d1f11954304a9c72b8a22209886.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue your undead family and swap between them in real-time, mixing and matching their abilities for maximum damage. Experiment with combos, wreck some Cure Bots, and remind the living why zombies do it better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/9eae8958f639a73b26f90ca217bad52d.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porto Morto is your undead paradise, and it\u2019s not going down without a fight. Scavenge parts, restore your town, and help your zombie neighbors reclaim their afterlife - one ridiculous restoration project at a time. But as you rebuild, you\u2019ll uncover the real reason C.A.R.E. is so desperate to control zombie-kind\u2026 and it\u2019s worse than just wiping you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, STAY DEAD is a love letter to weirdos, a rebellion against the idea that \u201cnormal\u201d is worth saving. In Porto Morto, death is just the beginning. And it rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856